WEBVTT

00:09.410 --> 00:10.710
Sorry.

00:12.110 --> 00:13.400
Work's been busy.

00:14.670 --> 00:16.700
It's okay. I'll do it.

00:18.740 --> 00:20.180
Hey, thanks.

00:22.410 --> 00:25.170
<b>Nature Study</b>

00:23.020 --> 00:25.150
Split into groups of three.

00:25.150 --> 00:25.900
Three, huh?

00:25.170 --> 00:28.420
<b>Nature Study</b>

00:25.800 --> 00:27.270
We can't do four?

00:26.350 --> 00:28.080
Now what?

00:28.900 --> 00:31.970
Okay, I'll join some other group.

00:31.970 --> 00:33.170
Sorry.

00:33.570 --> 00:35.350
Kuga, you'll switch with me?

00:35.870 --> 00:36.880
Thanks.

00:36.880 --> 00:38.190
That's a big help.

00:47.100 --> 00:50.190
You win

00:48.780 --> 00:50.190
You won!

00:50.370 --> 00:52.110
Lucky you!

00:52.110 --> 00:54.200
Then I'll give it to you, Moka-nee.

00:54.200 --> 00:55.480
After I wash it off.

00:56.590 --> 01:00.190
No, I want to win on my own.

01:00.810 --> 01:02.690
That one's yours, Ichiro-kun.

01:29.970 --> 01:34.890
<i>It's easier to let good things go, 
so I forgot how to accept them...</i>

01:35.920 --> 01:37.520
<i>despite how happy I would've been.</i>

01:48.210 --> 01:55.510
Looks like it started before I knew it

01:56.260 --> 02:01.300
Thanks to you, I'm all smiles

02:03.220 --> 02:11.270
The usual townscape lends 
charm to the two of us

02:11.270 --> 02:16.780
Funny how it looks like a starry sky

02:20.530 --> 02:22.620
Suddenly buying flowers

02:22.620 --> 02:24.620
Standing around in the kitchen

02:24.620 --> 02:27.830
Sending a photo, because 
the setting sun is pretty

02:27.830 --> 02:32.380
Trying to spend as much 
time with you as I can

02:32.380 --> 02:35.380
This is all new for me

02:37.260 --> 02:42.930
I hope tomorrow is like today

02:43.260 --> 02:49.480
I've never felt this way before

02:49.480 --> 02:55.070
We'll go on a date this weekend if possible

02:55.730 --> 03:00.990
But it's fine if we stay home

03:02.240 --> 03:05.450
I can't wait to see you

03:07.950 --> 03:12.960
<b><b>Episode 11</b></b>

03:07.950 --> 03:12.960
<b><b>Stinger Removal</b></b>

03:07.950 --> 03:12.960
<b><b>with Kuga-Kun</b></b>

03:12.960 --> 03:15.710
<b>Hiiragi Apartments</b>

03:13.730 --> 03:15.140
Greetings.

03:16.110 --> 03:17.880
I am Momiji Makado.

03:17.880 --> 03:20.180
I'm Keigo Komaki...

03:20.180 --> 03:25.510
We will perform the ceremony 
to annul your pact.

03:25.830 --> 03:27.480
Here's hoping it goes well.

03:27.480 --> 03:30.010
Thank you for coming all the way here.

03:30.010 --> 03:31.540
Please, come on inside—

03:33.430 --> 03:35.550
A-Are you all right?

03:36.020 --> 03:38.190
Looks like he got seasick on the ship.

03:38.190 --> 03:40.480
The waves were especially rough today.

03:40.720 --> 03:43.960
Pull yourself together. 
You're in front of the princess.

03:44.930 --> 03:49.010
Komaki is one thing, 
but Makado is on my side.

03:49.280 --> 03:52.120
That trusted staff member you mentioned...

03:53.680 --> 03:55.240
is Makado-san?

03:58.040 --> 03:59.170
And so...

04:02.820 --> 04:04.370
This is what we will use.

04:05.470 --> 04:06.940
These are the forceps?

04:06.940 --> 04:11.230
Yes, forceps made from 
the island's Yobi stone.

04:11.230 --> 04:13.020
<i>Tweezers, huh?</i>

04:13.380 --> 04:16.660
We will use the forceps to remove 
the princess's stinger from you.

04:16.660 --> 04:19.290
That's roughly what the ceremony involves.

04:19.540 --> 04:23.010
So, you need a ceremony to annul the pact.

04:23.640 --> 04:28.060
Technically yes, but we will 
prepare the site and the clothing.

04:28.060 --> 04:31.410
You will not need to do much to prepare.

04:31.410 --> 04:34.710
Please just follow our lead 
on the day in question.

04:35.060 --> 04:38.160
Th-That's all we have to do?

04:38.410 --> 04:42.040
Oh, Princess, are your
 clothing sizes still the same?

04:42.040 --> 04:43.270
Naturally.

04:43.270 --> 04:46.020
May I take your measurements, Kuga-san?

04:46.020 --> 04:48.400
Oh, uh, sure.

04:48.400 --> 04:49.540
Excuse me.

04:50.400 --> 04:52.400
I'd like to use your bathroom.

04:55.970 --> 04:58.960
Keigo, you need to get some rest.

05:01.240 --> 05:03.290
I'll have him rest in my room.

05:03.290 --> 05:05.330
Okay. Hope you feel better.

05:05.940 --> 05:08.470
I'm sorry, Princess...

05:08.470 --> 05:10.830
Shall we, then?

05:21.710 --> 05:24.420
Um, what kind of clothing?

05:24.420 --> 05:25.660
Traditional formal attire.

05:26.440 --> 05:29.340
But we're short on time, 
so it'll be ready-made.

05:29.560 --> 05:33.340
Well, I've never worn anything 
fancier than a yukata.

05:33.340 --> 05:35.090
It's extravagant, isn't it?

05:35.090 --> 05:39.790
We just want the sacred Yobi stone to 
be presented as sacredly as possible.

05:39.790 --> 05:43.620
Location and attire don't 
mean a thing, truth be told.

05:44.540 --> 05:49.100
Did Goshiki-san's grandmother 
come up with the ceremony, too?

05:49.530 --> 05:50.620
Yes.

05:51.180 --> 05:54.250
Our previous leader Aya-sama 
happened upon a shooting star,

05:54.250 --> 06:01.250
and it granted her wish, bringing 
tranquility and blessings to the islanders.

06:02.310 --> 06:03.820
Blessings...

06:03.820 --> 06:08.340
When I say "blessing," 
I mean a beautiful world

06:08.340 --> 06:12.750
where the islanders love Goshiki, 
and they care for and help one another.

06:13.760 --> 06:18.150
On the other hand, they've also 
become insular, so in her later years,

06:18.450 --> 06:21.560
Aya-sama seemed to have regrets 
about what she had built.

06:24.590 --> 06:30.120
I originally worked for Aya-sama, 
so I want to be of help to the princess.

06:30.490 --> 06:33.610
Sorry this is all so restrictive for you.

06:33.610 --> 06:34.900
Not at all.

06:35.580 --> 06:40.200
Anyway, thank goodness we 
can finally annul the pact.

06:42.020 --> 06:44.740
I don't like how hard it makes 
things for Goshiki-san.

06:46.840 --> 06:48.250
You love her.

06:48.740 --> 06:50.480
Uh, well...

06:50.480 --> 06:54.950
Even though a tool exists for it, as far as 
I know this is the first ever pact annulment.

06:54.950 --> 06:57.420
Therefore I can't be sure about this.

06:58.230 --> 07:03.320
But it's possible the feelings you have for 
each other are simply due to the pact.

07:07.400 --> 07:10.380
But again, I can't be sure.

07:13.230 --> 07:17.210
You could have just stayed 
on the island, Keigo.

07:17.470 --> 07:20.460
But I wanted to see you.

07:20.460 --> 07:25.090
Miyako-sama was here too last time, 
so you and I hardly got to talk.

07:27.130 --> 07:29.240
You can feel free to take it easy.

07:30.400 --> 07:34.230
Wait, please! It's been so long 
since I've heard your voice!

07:35.740 --> 07:38.990
It doesn't seem possible 
to exchange thoughts here.

07:39.240 --> 07:40.150
Princess.

07:42.210 --> 07:44.260
Miyako-sama gave me this.

07:47.050 --> 07:48.980
It's a piece of the Yobi stone.

07:49.170 --> 07:53.480
She said with this, our minds should 
be able to link even off the island.

07:54.170 --> 07:55.400
<i>Keigo...</i>

07:58.340 --> 08:00.050
<i>Everyone is waiting for you.</i>

08:00.810 --> 08:01.740
<i>Princess!</i>

08:05.350 --> 08:06.940
<i>Princess!</i>

08:06.940 --> 08:08.920
<i>Your Highness!</i>

08:13.510 --> 08:17.250
I'm sorry. I don't intend to go back.

08:17.250 --> 08:19.050
Is it because of that man?

08:19.830 --> 08:24.510
I mean, I guess even some outsiders 
would be attracted to you,

08:24.800 --> 08:28.400
but without a pact, there's no telling when 
a guy like him would have a change of heart.

08:28.800 --> 08:30.530
There's no chance of that.

08:30.530 --> 08:33.000
But isn't his devotion due to the pact?

08:33.540 --> 08:37.270
Once it's annulled, 
I bet those feelings will vanish.

08:44.290 --> 08:47.290
<b>Hiiragi Apartments</b>

08:45.300 --> 08:47.290
See you tomorrow, then.

08:47.720 --> 08:49.550
We'll come get you in the afternoon.

08:49.550 --> 08:50.440
All right.

08:50.440 --> 08:51.550
See you.

09:01.000 --> 09:03.320
I'm nervous about tomorrow.

09:03.630 --> 09:06.910
But we can finally annul the pact.

09:07.260 --> 09:08.550
That'll be great!

09:08.790 --> 09:09.830
Yeah!

09:09.830 --> 09:11.320
It sure will.

09:23.120 --> 09:25.330
Did the guests leave?

09:26.200 --> 09:29.390
Oh yeah, sorry. It's over now.

09:29.390 --> 09:30.540
You okay?

09:31.080 --> 09:32.920
Something happened, didn't it?

09:32.920 --> 09:34.080
Didn't it?

09:34.080 --> 09:35.830
No, we're fine!

09:36.240 --> 09:38.780
There's nothing for you guys to worry about.

09:42.160 --> 09:43.420
Are you gonna leave?

09:44.100 --> 09:46.110
I-I'm not!

09:46.970 --> 09:48.110
Really?

09:48.110 --> 09:48.970
Yes.

09:48.970 --> 09:52.120
We were talking about making 
hot chocolate. Want some?

09:52.570 --> 09:53.820
You bet!

10:03.480 --> 10:05.120
It's so warm!

10:07.440 --> 10:09.070
And tasty.

10:09.070 --> 10:11.620
Fumio, your glasses are all white!

10:11.830 --> 10:13.400
All white.

10:17.480 --> 10:19.430
Here, Fumio-san.

10:30.400 --> 10:30.520
Incoming call

10:30.400 --> 10:30.520
Momoka Morikuni

10:30.520 --> 10:30.650
Incoming call

10:30.520 --> 10:30.650
Momoka Morikuni

10:30.650 --> 10:30.770
Incoming call

10:30.650 --> 10:30.770
Momoka Morikuni

10:30.770 --> 10:32.150
Incoming call

10:30.770 --> 10:32.150
Momoka Morikuni

10:32.360 --> 10:34.130
<i>Hello.</i>

10:34.130 --> 10:35.960
Happy New Year.

10:35.960 --> 10:37.950
I received a bunch of gifts for the holiday.

10:37.950 --> 10:40.150
Mind if I give some of them to you again?

10:40.150 --> 10:42.640
By all means. Thank you.

10:45.210 --> 10:46.430
Did something happen?

10:46.430 --> 10:48.930
<i>N-No, I-I mean...</i>

10:49.540 --> 10:50.850
Well...

10:51.660 --> 10:53.220
<i>Maybe it did.</i>

10:54.800 --> 10:57.970
Why don't you let Machi and Fumio 
come over here from time to time?

10:57.970 --> 11:01.680
And then go spend some time 
alone with Goshiki-san.

11:01.680 --> 11:05.180
<i>Although I imagine you'd say it's 
plenty fun with the four of you.</i>

11:06.400 --> 11:07.950
Okay, yeah.

11:07.950 --> 11:09.930
I might take you up on that tomorrow.

11:11.210 --> 11:17.260
There's somewhere we <i>have</i> to go, 
and I forgot Chibi-chan won't be here.

11:17.260 --> 11:18.810
<i>Oh, is that so?</i>

11:19.070 --> 11:24.630
I mean, tell me if you can't do it. 
I know it's your New Year's holiday.

11:24.630 --> 11:28.520
<i>No, it's totally cool! I love 
watching kids do their thing.</i>

11:28.520 --> 11:29.830
Thank you.

11:30.070 --> 11:32.490
<i>So, what did happen?</i>

11:32.490 --> 11:35.230
Nothing specifically.

11:35.230 --> 11:39.500
I'm just, you know, 
going out with Goshiki-san.

11:40.450 --> 11:47.110
It's the first time I've ever felt 
so strongly about someone else.

11:47.990 --> 11:51.480
When I think, what if this 
situation might come to an end...

11:52.970 --> 11:54.450
It scares me.

11:54.450 --> 11:57.390
<i>You're kidding me! 
</i>You<i>, boasting about your love life?!</i>

11:58.150 --> 12:01.060
B-Boasting? Is that what I'm doing?

12:01.060 --> 12:02.740
<i>This is great!</i>

12:03.040 --> 12:07.840
Look, nobody understands
how or why feelings change.

12:09.220 --> 12:12.100
<i>But hey, change is fun in its own way.</i>

12:12.100 --> 12:15.200
<i>A moment and an eternity 
are both good things.</i>

12:15.620 --> 12:17.900
Yeah, thanks.

12:18.790 --> 12:21.110
Also for helping out tomorrow.

12:21.110 --> 12:22.770
<i>Sure, we've got your back.</i>

12:22.770 --> 12:23.750
Okay, bye.

12:30.840 --> 12:32.890
<i>May what I felt that time...</i>

12:34.650 --> 12:36.940
<i>...be the real thing.</i>

12:53.210 --> 12:55.280
Princess, listen to this!

12:55.590 --> 12:58.040
You and I might be able to marry!

12:59.270 --> 13:03.120
I can become a candidate. I'm so happy!

13:03.440 --> 13:05.480
Aren't you still a child, Keigo?

13:05.480 --> 13:07.810
I'll be an adult soon!

13:07.810 --> 13:10.290
I'll work hard to be your choice!

13:13.510 --> 13:16.050
What about me do you like?

13:17.220 --> 13:19.010
You're the princess, Princess.

13:20.750 --> 13:21.860
I see.

13:26.560 --> 13:33.570
<i>I find myself wondering how things 
would be if I weren't the princess.</i>

13:34.960 --> 13:38.460
Princess Rose
Funeko Horehoro

13:34.960 --> 13:38.460
Under the Azure Moon
Funeko Horehoro

13:36.510 --> 13:37.800
Grandmother?

13:40.800 --> 13:41.780
Books?

13:50.080 --> 13:52.220
<b>Under the Azure Moon</b>

13:50.080 --> 13:52.220
<b>Funeko Horehoro</b>

14:00.230 --> 14:03.230
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

14:00.230 --> 14:03.230
I don't
care
about
honor
or
social
standing.

14:00.230 --> 14:03.230
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

14:00.230 --> 14:03.230
I
love
you.

14:04.980 --> 14:06.410
<i>This is lovely!</i>

14:07.210 --> 14:12.920
<i>I could have broadened my imagination... 
no, my fantasies this way!</i>

14:14.510 --> 14:18.290
<i>I could be free to choose 
what I love, and whom.</i>

14:22.340 --> 14:25.100
<i>This is love!</i>

14:27.380 --> 14:32.470
Would you go out with me with the 
intent to someday get married?!

14:37.580 --> 14:39.980
But isn't his devotion due to the pact?

14:40.890 --> 14:43.780
Once it's annulled, 
those feelings will vanish.

14:58.060 --> 15:03.790
<i>What would I do if Kuga-san's 
feelings were to change tomorrow?</i>

15:05.690 --> 15:12.310
<i>If even our feelings are due 
to the pact, then I might lose him.</i>

15:14.420 --> 15:15.740
Kuga-san...

15:25.940 --> 15:27.680
Tea is ready.

15:33.140 --> 15:34.590
Care to join me?

15:34.590 --> 15:35.450
Yes.

15:38.180 --> 15:41.630
She'll be fine. I'm sure it will work.

15:44.570 --> 15:47.080
Yes, I am too.

15:55.870 --> 15:57.420
<i>I look terrible.</i>

15:57.840 --> 15:59.980
Princess, it's Keigo.

15:59.980 --> 16:01.210
Come in.

16:02.320 --> 16:05.560
The time has come. Are you prepared?

16:05.950 --> 16:06.780
Yes.

16:10.680 --> 16:13.310
I-I love you.

16:13.310 --> 16:15.360
I mean, you look lovely, Princess!

16:16.490 --> 16:17.870
Thank you.

16:18.240 --> 16:20.150
Could you and I just...

16:20.150 --> 16:22.880
I mean, I'll work hard!

16:22.880 --> 16:25.380
So that I can be your choice.

16:26.200 --> 16:30.380
So let's make <i>sure</i> today's 
ceremony is a success!

16:41.730 --> 16:43.680
W-We're really doing it here?

16:43.680 --> 16:46.130
Like I said, extravagant.

16:46.440 --> 16:48.760
Where are Goshiki-san's parents?

16:48.760 --> 16:52.420
They haven't come. The family head can't 
be away from the island for long.

16:53.430 --> 16:57.770
Don't worry. We'll record it all
 and show it to them.

17:05.080 --> 17:06.590
Goshiki-san.

17:09.970 --> 17:11.440
You okay?

17:12.110 --> 17:13.250
Yes.

17:13.860 --> 17:16.070
You're not looking too well.

17:18.070 --> 17:19.550
I'm fine.

17:20.690 --> 17:22.540
Princess, this way.

17:29.310 --> 17:32.860
<i>We should have discussed 
this more yesterday.</i>

17:46.350 --> 17:47.970
The camera is ready.

17:50.480 --> 17:53.720
<i>At any rate, how </i>do<i>
you remove the stinger?</i>

17:54.390 --> 17:56.160
<i>Is this safe?</i>

18:02.780 --> 18:05.740
We will now begin the 
Stinger Removal Ceremony.

18:06.070 --> 18:10.450
This sake is sacred to the island, 
as it was dedicated to the Yobi stone.

18:10.790 --> 18:14.410
It will cause the stinger that 
stung Kuga-san to manifest.

18:20.100 --> 18:21.500
Go on and drink.

18:21.500 --> 18:23.120
Oh, okay.

18:33.140 --> 18:35.650
Now, we wait.

18:35.650 --> 18:36.580
Okay.

18:52.390 --> 18:53.320
What's this?!

18:53.320 --> 18:54.510
Are you all right?!

18:54.770 --> 18:57.290
Please pull on that, and extract it.

19:05.260 --> 19:07.710
Please lift your hands if it hurts.

19:08.210 --> 19:09.520
I'm fine!

19:09.520 --> 19:10.590
Go on, do it!

19:10.900 --> 19:12.430
Remain calm.

19:12.430 --> 19:14.450
Gently, gently.

19:21.820 --> 19:22.790
Wait—

19:23.830 --> 19:26.820
<i>Now what? This is really happening.</i>

19:27.480 --> 19:30.210
<i>We know a bond linking us 
together will be severed.</i>

19:31.210 --> 19:34.810
<i>I should have talked more
and gotten you to smile.</i>

19:35.340 --> 19:39.850
<i>Sorry I couldn't respond right away, 
even though you share so much with me.</i>

19:40.320 --> 19:45.060
<i>It's like it's a present I can't open 
because it's too good for me.</i>

19:46.340 --> 19:49.190
<i>I shouldn't have said I was too 
embarrassed to accept them.</i>

19:49.530 --> 19:51.700
<i>Or that I wanted to hang 
on to them for later.</i>

19:52.470 --> 19:56.950
<i>I should have opened the gifts 
I was given and been happy!</i>

20:05.580 --> 20:08.500
<i>I want you to know I love you.</i>

20:34.850 --> 20:36.910
It seems to have ended without incident.

20:48.070 --> 20:49.510
Are you all right?

20:51.860 --> 20:53.260
Good for you.

20:55.640 --> 20:59.340
This means you're free now.

21:06.320 --> 21:08.360
Tell me, do—

21:11.640 --> 21:15.860
Do you still love me?

21:26.880 --> 21:28.320
I love you!

21:36.330 --> 21:37.880
And I love you!

21:41.490 --> 21:43.630
Y-You!

21:43.630 --> 21:46.090
Yes, yes, our job is done.

21:46.090 --> 21:48.060
Time to go.

21:48.580 --> 21:49.780
P-Princess!

21:50.890 --> 21:52.720
Princess!

21:53.600 --> 21:54.840
Princess!

22:16.060 --> 22:27.650
A red thread winding around our legs
(nearby)

22:27.650 --> 22:38.800
Just as the tightly tied knot comes undone

22:38.800 --> 22:45.480
Maybe if our feelings come together

22:45.480 --> 22:52.390
We can be like this forever

22:52.390 --> 23:02.230
A tug on my arm, by the bond that was formed that day

23:02.230 --> 23:08.090
A little at a time, we've come closer together

23:08.090 --> 23:12.880
More smiles for us

23:12.880 --> 23:25.690
That place I first learned of, and the shops we'll visit again tomorrow

23:25.690 --> 23:31.650
They'll all be part of these lovely days

23:31.650 --> 23:37.470
Cherished all the way

23:37.470 --> 23:43.780
Looking forward to it, good night

23:45.890 --> 23:48.030
Good for you, Ichiro and Shio-chan!

23:48.030 --> 23:49.190
Happy.

23:49.190 --> 23:51.590
But will things work out in the end?

23:51.590 --> 23:52.850
Oh no.

23:52.850 --> 23:55.040
Don't say things that make us anxious!

23:55.040 --> 23:56.630
At last, the final episode.

23:56.240 --> 23:59.900
<b><b>Episode 12</b></b>

23:56.240 --> 23:59.900
<b><b>Fireworks with the Princess</b></b>

23:56.630 --> 23:57.560
Everyone,

23:57.560 --> 23:58.970
be sure to watch!
